					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I personally like the last line; I can almost see them as having come up with and identified themselves as some other name. Then the Foundation (and likely others) started calling them the Chaos Insurgency, and they let it stick.</p> <p>Almost has a kind of &quot;You want me to be the bad guy? FINE, I'm the bad guy!&quot; feel to it.</p> 
				 	]]>
